{"run_id": "run_ff74ff88c5f1", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s01_course_notify_accept", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是负责人，有什么事请讲。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我们将在课程发布页面新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原发布流程不变。您可以根据课程场景选择。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，明白了。那这两个选项有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播成本较低，延迟约5-10秒，适合大班课；低延迟直播延迟约1-2秒，互动体验更好，适合小班课或实操课。需要实时互动时建议选择低延迟直播。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "低延迟直播是不是更贵？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "低延迟直播链路保障更强，成本通常高于标准直播，具体以页面配置和合同约定为准。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那之前我们用的是哪种？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "之前后台统一配置的是低延迟链路。您通过Web控制台、校验系统还是SaaS系统发布课程？我可以指导您查看或配置低延迟直播。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "我们用的是Web控制台。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，在Web控制台的课程发布页面，您会看到新增的直播类型选项，选择低延迟直播即可。如果看不到，可能是后台配置尚未完成，稍后刷新或联系平台确认权限。"}, {"turn": 12, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，还有其他需要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 13, "role": "agent", "content": "后续我们会通过企业微信发送通知，请关注同步提示。您还有其他问题吗？"}, {"turn": 14, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢。"}, {"turn": 15, "role": "agent", "content": "不客气，祝您工作顺利，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 12, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 13, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 14, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 15, "task_status": "notified", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
