{"run_id": "run_ff74ff88c5f1", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s06_course_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵机构课程发布的负责人吗？这边同步一个直播发布配置更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我正在上课，请简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，长话短说。直播发布页面将新增“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原流程不变。您之前用的是后台统一配置的低延迟链路，知道吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，知道。有什么区别？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "标准直播延迟5-10秒，成本低，适合大班课；低延迟直播1-2秒，互动好，适合小班课或实操课，费用稍高。您通过什么系统发布课程？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "Web控制台。我现在没时间细看，回头再说吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "理解，那我稍后安排回访，详细指导您配置。后续企业微信也会发通知，请留意。您看方便什么时间？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "今天下午3点后吧。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，下午3点后回访。您先忙，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 7, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "preferred_time": "2025-03-21 15:00"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
